#: FreePicker/__init__.py:1
msgid "A fully self-contained picker with custom Pose/Object sets and a floating editable panel."
msgstr "完全独立的拾取器，带自定义姿态/物体选择集和可编辑浮动面板。"

#: FreePicker/core.py:1
msgid "A fully self-contained picker: its own Pose-mode bone sets and Object-mode sets (does NOT use Blender's native Bone Selection Sets, so it will not conflict or share data with other addons such as 'Quick Selection Sets'), drawn as a floating panel with an Edit Mode that lets you drag and resize each button freely to build a custom picker layout."
msgstr "完全独立的拾取器：拥有自己的姿态模式骨骼选择集和物体模式选择集（不使用 Blender 原生的骨骼选择集，因此不会与其他插件（如“Quick Selection Sets”）冲突或共享数据），以浮动面板形式绘制，并提供编辑模式，可自由拖动和调整每个按钮大小，以构建自定义拾取器布局。"

